<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">– Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja Apaulo kwa Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bhaf</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jammbone handa chiijandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Apaulo</para>
  <para style="imt">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua kwa Bhaefeso jikajandikwa mu muuda gumo na pajikajandikwa balua ya Bhakolosai mu chaaka cha 60 baada ja kubhelekwa Ayesu Kilisito. Jwaakajandika akachikongolela mweene handa Andundame Apaulo, mu chula ja 1:1. Akaachomi bhajingi bhatendakondanga kubhee Apaulo akajandika balua jenjeni kwa Bhaefeso, hata handa balua jenejo jangali na chalamu jabhe mweene handa chiibhile kwa balua ja Bhakolosai. Ligongo helyo, komboleka jikapalikwa jitiindilwe pakati ja mabhoga ga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito gagabhile mu chilambo chenecho. Kabhele, Apaulo pabhakajandika balua jenejo akibha atabhitwe, mu chula ja 3:1, 4:1, 6:20. Apaulo akajipeleka balua jenejo kwa kwaalagia Atikiko jwaakibha mu makongano ga kulityangila libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha ku Efeso, mu chula ja 6:2, 1-22.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso chikibha nga chilambo chikolongwa na mamulaka gabhe makolongwa ga ku Loma mu chilambo chichoko cha Asia. Chilambo cha ku Efeso chikibha chitendakumanyikana muno kubhokana na Nyuumba ja Annoongo jijikabhee monomwe na yakubhee likibha litekubhekwa kwa ligongo lya lihengo lya annoongo ahikege jwa Chiyunani chichikakemwa Alitemu, mu Hikubho chula ja 19:23-3-1. Libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito lilikibha ku Efeso likajemeka kongo libhi na machili nambo muuda gugukahika likachiobhalela, Uhunukulo chula ja 2:1-7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Apaulo atendakongolela mu chehemu ja kujemeka ja balua jenjeni henela Annoongo chibhakaagula bhandu na kwaaokoanga kubhoka mu mabohu gabhenji kupetela Ayesu Kilisito. Atendakulilandanikia libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito na mmele, na Akilisito handa mutwe gwabhe. Hela hela atendakulilandanikia libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito na nyuumba, na Akilisito handa liganga lya nchingi au liganga lya nnungulugulu lya nyuumba jenejo. Mu chehemu ja bhele ja chitabu chenjeni, Apaulo atendakongolela abhikulangia henala mundu jwaatekwahobhalela Akilisito chibhapalikwa kutama kwa kwanhobhalela jonojwe.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo atendakuchikongolela mweene na kwaachalimianga bhandu bha ku Efeso, mu chula ja 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Ngapena atendakongolela kubhandikilana pakati ja libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito na Akilisito, mu chula ja 1:3-3:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngapena Apaulo atendakujandika abhikulangia henela bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito chiipalikwa kutama, mu chula ja 4:1-6:20.</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo atendakujomolekea kwa kulongela malobhe ga kujomolekea, mu chula ja 6:21-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Nenga Apaulo, andundame bha Akilisito Yesu kwa upalio gwa Annoongo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Ndenda kunnyandikilanga mwangota mwa bhandu bha Annoongo bha konokwe ku Efeso, mummilinge mwa bhandu bha kuaminika mu kulondanika na Akilisito Yesu<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Ndenda kuntakianga umbone na kuhengwa kukubhoka kwa Annoongo Atati bhitu na kwa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annoongo atekutuhagula kupetela Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Alumbalilwe Annoongo Atati bha Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito, ligongo kwa kulondanika na Akilisito atutendile gammbone gajingi kupetela Mboomo jwa Annoongo kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kwa kubhee tangu ja kuhalakikwa kwa chilambo, Annoongo akatuagaula tubhee bhandu bhakwe mu kulondanika na Akilisito ili tubhee bhandu bha Annoongo na twangabhee na mabohu nnoongi jabhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Ligongo lya upaliho gwabhe, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Tangu ja kuhalakilwa kwa chilambo, Annoongo akapala kutenda henela tubhee bhabhe kwa ndela ja Ayesu Kilisito, henela nga chibhakabhajilwa na chibhakapala. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Bahi, twaalaumbalile Annoongo ligongo lya umbone gwabhe nkolo, gwaatupekie hiyoyo kupetela mwana jwabhe jwaampala kubhee handa ngwahupa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Kwa kulondekana na Akilisito twenga tutendakukombolewa kupetela miyahi jabhe, ligongo tutekulekelwa mabohu gitu. Henela nga chigubhile ukolo gwa umbone gwabhe, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />gubhatupekie tuumbe!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Kwa malango na kumanya kwabhe koha. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Annoongo akapangana chenichela chibhakachipala mweene, akatulobholela kwa ngani ja mpango gwabhe gugutekuchiiya, gubhakapala kugupangana kupetela Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Muda gwabhe pagukahika akapangana chenichela chibhakachipala, Akilisito apakutabhala pachilambo na kunani kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Mu kulondika na Akilisito, twenga tutekuhagulikwa kubhee bhandu bhabhe handa chibhakapala Annoongo tangu ja kuhalakikwa kwa chilambo. Annoongo atendakupangana hilebhe handa chibhapala mweene. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Annoongo akatenda henela, twenga Bhayahudi nga bhatukalongolela kwahobhalela Akilisito, tupalikwa kwaalumbalila Annoongo kwa ukolo gwabhe!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Hela hela na mwangota mwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, nkajoanga ngani ja kweli nga Ngani Jammbone jijikaaletelanga ukombohi kwa kwaahobhalela Akilisito. Annoongo ili kulangania mwangota nga bhakwe akammekanga chilolelo kwa kumpekea jonijola Mboomo jwakwe jwaakalobhola kubhee apakutepekea. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Mboomo jonojwe nga jwaapakututenda tupokele genigala goa Annoongo gabhakalobhola kubhee apakwapekea bhandu bhabhe, chikubho hecho chitulangia kubhee Annoongo apakwaakomboanga bhandu bhabhe. Twenga tulumbalile ukolo gwabhe!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwaajopa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Kubhokela panakajoa henela chimwahobhalela Hangwana Ayesu na kwaapala bhandu bhoa bha Annoongo, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />nangaleka ng'o kwaachukulu Annoongo ligongo linunji. Ndendakunkombokelanga pandendakwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ndendakuendelea kwaajopa Annoongo jwa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito, Atati jwa ukolo, ampekeange mwangota Mboomo jwabhe jwaapakuntendanga mmangange kubhee bhandu bhakwe na kunhunukulilanga ili nkombolange kummanya Annoongo maha. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Ndendakwaajopa Annoongo ajihunukule mitima jinunji ili nkombolange kugubhona nhana gwabhe, ili mpatange kulupalila kubhatekunkemelanga na ukolo gwabhe nkolo kwa genigala gabhatekwabhekelanga bhandu bhabhe. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Ndendakwaajopa Annoongo ili kombolange kumanya machili gakwe makolongwa muno ligongo lya twenga bhatuhobhalela. Uwecho gonogwe gugupangana lihengo nkati jitu gulandana na machili genigala makolo muno, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />yakubhee akagatumia pabhakaayoa Akilisito, akaabheka lubhoko lwabhe lwa kunnelo konokwe kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Konokwe kunani kwa Annoongo, Akilisito akibha akolo kwa akaakolo bhoa na bhabhabhilinge na mamulaka bhoa na bhabhabhile na machili na akaamwenye. Kabhele atendita kutabhala kila chichikemwa mu chilambo chenjeni na chilambo chichiika. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Annoongo ampekie Akilisito mamulaka ya hilebhe yoa, na atekwaatenda Akilisito jwaatawala kila chilebhe, abhee mutwe kwa bhandu bhoa bhabhahobhalela Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito nga mmele gwabhe Akilisito, na akilisito jwaalitenda libhobha lya bhandu lilyaahobhalela jonojwe likamilike.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubhoka kukujomoka kujingila mu umomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Pena kandahi mwangota mwakibha handa ntekujomokanga ligongo lya kulemwa na mabohu ginunji. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Gonigola muuda nkatamanga kwa kukagula hikubho hibohu ya bhandu bha chilambo chenjeni, na ntendita kwajoanikia atabhala abohu jwa mahoka jwa machili jwa kunani, lihoka jwaatawala bhandu bhangaajeketela Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Twenga twabhoa kabhele tukatama handa bhenaangota, tukatama kwa kukagula kulokolila kwitu kwa pachilambo na kupangana hikubho yela hiikaibhajila mimele na luunda lwitu. Twenga tukapalikwa kulagiwa na Annoongo.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Nambo Annoongo jwabhii na kiha muno. Akatupala kwa upaliho nkolongwa muno, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />hata handa tukibha handa tutekujomoka ligongo lya mabohu gitu, akatutenda tubhee akaamomi pamo na Akilisito. Kwa umbone gwa Annoongo mwangota ntekuokolewanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kwa kulondanika na Akilisto Ayesu, Annoongo akatuyoa pamo na jonojwe ili tukatawale pamo na jonojwe kunani kwa Annoongo, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />henela nga chibhakapala kulangia kwa bhandu machobha gagahika ukolo gwa umbone gwabhe jwabhakatupekea kwa ntima gwammbone mu kulondekana kwitu na Akilisito Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Maana kwa umbone gwabhe Annoongo ntekombolewanga kwa ndela ja kwahobhalela Akilisito, ngabha kwa hikubho yinu yammbone. Jenjeni nga ngwahupa kubhoka kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Wala ngabhokana na hikubho yinu mwaachinabhene, henela akotokubhee mundu jwa kuchilumbalila. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Maana Annoongo akatuhalakia twenga mu kulondekana na Akilisito Yesu, kupala tutame kwa kupangana hikubho yammbone, gabhatupanganikie kubhokela lolo ili tukombole kutama mu kutenda genago.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhee pamo mu Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Bahi nkombokelange pena lolo mwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, Bhayahudi bhakankemanga mwa bhandu, “Bhangahinwanga” Nambo bhenaangota bhabhachikemanga, “Bhandu bhabhatekuhinwa” Ligongo lya chenichela chibhatenditinge mu mimele jabhenji. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Machobha gala mwangota nkatamanga pangali kwaamanya Akilisito, nkibha mmekitwe kutali kubhoka kwa malubhalo ga Bhaisilaeli bhabhakibha bhandu bha Annoongo, nkibhanga akaageni mu genigala malagano gabhakalobhola Annoongo kubhee apakutenda. Nkatamanga pangali kulupalila na handa bhandu bhabhangaamanya Annoongo pachilambo pani. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Nambo nangocheni, kwa kulondanika na Kilisito Ayesu, mwangota mwakibhanga kutali na Annoongo pena kandai, nangocheni mmandikile kupetela ndela ja mihai ja Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Kwa kubhee Akilisito mweene nga jwaatuletile kuhengwa kwitu, kwa kwaatendanga Bhayahudi na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhabhee chilebhe chimo. Kwa kugubhoa mmele gwabhe akabhoa mpwato gugukatulekania handa likukumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Akagabhoa genigala Malagilo ga Amusa pamo na genigala goha gabhagakalagia ili abhatendange Bhayahudi na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhabhee chilebhe chimo mu kulondekana na Akilisito, na kwa kutenda henela akatuletela kuhengwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Akagubhoa mmele gwabhe kubhee handa mbeeko, Akilisito akagubhoa upwati gwabhenji kwa ndela ja kujomoka kwabhe panchalaba, henela kwaatenda bhakamulane mabhako na Annoongo na kugatenda gena mabhoga gabhele na kubhee chilebhe chimo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Bahi, Akilisto akahika na kutangacha Ngani Jammbone ja kuhengwa kwinunji mwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bha bhammilinge kutali na Annoongo, na kabhele kwa Bhayahudi bhabhabhandikile na Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Henela, kupetela Akilisito, twenga twabhoa Akayahudi na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, tutendakombola kwaajendela Atati kupetela Mboomo jwa Annoongo.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Bahi, mwangota mwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi ngabha akaageni na wala ngabha bhandu bha kupeta. Mwangota nga akaakola chilambo pamo na bhandu bha Annoongo, hela hela nga bhandu bha ulongo gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Mwangota hela hela ntekuchengwanga panani ja nchingi gugubhekitwe na akaandundame na akaalondohi, na bhena Akilisito bheene alandana na liganga likolongwa lilikamulila nyuumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Jonojwe nga jwalondanika nyuumba joha na kujitenda jibhee ngolongwa handa Nyuumba ja Annoongo mweene ligongo lya Hangwana. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Mu kulondanika na Akilisito, mwangota kabhele ntekuchengwangwa pamo na bhandu bhangi bhoa, mmangange nyuumba jibhatama Annoongo kupetela Mboomo jwabhe.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya Apaulo kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Nenga Apaulo junakatabhwa ligongo lya kwaatumikila Ayesu Kilisito na ligongo linunji mwangota mwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, ndendakunnyopelanga kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Panga lipamba ntekujoanga kubhee Annoongo kwa umbone gwabhe atekumbekea lihengo hele lya kuntangachianga mwangota Ngani Jammbone. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Annoongo atekuhunukulila nigamanye gagachihite kwa kuhunukulilwa. Handa chinakalongolela kujandika kwa malobhe kachoko, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />mwangota pampakuchoma malobhe gangu mpakombola kumanya henela chindendakumanya genigala gagatekuchiiya mu Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Lolo bhandu bhangakongolelwa hikubho yeneyo hiitekuchiiya, nambo ngocheni Annoongo atekwahunukulila genago gagachihite akaandundame na akaalondohi bhakwe kupetela Mboomo jwabhe. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Genigala gagatekuchiiya nga gangani, kupetela Ngani Jammbone, Bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhapatitinge genigala gabhakalobhola Annoongo kubhee apakwapekea Bhayahudi, bhena bhandu nga yeega ya mmele gumo, na bhenaangota bhapakupokelanga genigala gabhakalobholelwa na Annoongo kubhee apakwapekeanga kupetela Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ndekubhee antumichi jwa Ngani Jammbone kwa ndela ja umbone gubhatekumbekea Annoongo kupetela uwecho gwabhe nkolo. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nenga naachokochoko kupeta bhandu bhoa bha Annoongo, nambo atekumbekea nenga umbone gwabhe, gwa kutangachanga Ngani Jammbone ja Akilisito kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi umbone gwabhe Akilisito gwangalobholekwa, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />na kwaatangachia bhandu bhoa bhalolange mpango gwa Annoongo gugutekuchiiya chikutendwa. Annoongo jwaatekuhalakia hilebhe yoa akahiiya yeniyela yangamanyikana kubhokela kandai, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />ili ngocheni kupetela libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito, akaamwenye na akaakola machili bha kunani kwa Annoongo bhamanyange malango ga Annoongo mu hikubho yoa, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Annoongo atendite chikubho hecho kwa ndela ja Akilisito Ayesu Hangwana bhitu, handa chibhakapala mweene machobha goa pangali kupela. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Bahi, kwa kulondanika na Akilisito na kwahobhalela, twenga tukombola kwaajendela Annoongo kwa kuhobhalela. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Henela, ndendakunyopanga nkotokuwee ntima kubhokana na chindendakulaga ligongo linu, kwa kubhee genago nga ligongo lya ukolo gwinu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upalio gwa Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ligongo helyo, ndendakwaajopa Atati Annoongo kwa kwaatindibhalila majugwa, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />jonojwe nga ndaando ja hilebhe yoa ya kunani kwa Annoongo na pachilambo. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ndendakwaajopa Annoongo akombole kunnekelanga machili mumitima jinunji kupetela Mboomo jwabhe, kubhokana na ukola hilebhe na ukolo gwabhe, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />na ndendakwaajopa Akilisito atame mumitima jinunji kwa ndela ja kunhobhalela. Ndendakunnyopelanga kwa Annoongo goagola gantendanga gabhokele mu upalio gwa kweli, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />ili mwangota pamo na bhandu bha Annoongo, muhimanyange henela Akilisito chibhatupala muno kwa upalio gwangapela. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Kweli, nkombolange kugumanya upaliho gwa Akilisito kupeta chibhamanya bhandu bhoa, ili bhoa nkombolange kutendangwa bhakukamilikanga muno kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Annoongo akombola kupangana hikubho yakangachika muno kupeta yeniyela hiitujoine na kuganikia, kwa ndela ja uwecho gwabhe gugupangana mahengo nkati jitu. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Alumbalilwe Annoongo kwa ndela ja kwahobhalela Akilisito na ndela ja Ayesu mweene kwa hibhelei yoa na machobha goa pangali kupela! Na jibhee henela.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulondekana mu mmele gwa Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Bahi, nenga jwandekubhee ntabhikwa ligongo lya kwaatumikila Hangwana, ndendakumpembeleanga ntamange handa chintekemwanga na Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Mmangange mwabhandu bha kutongamanika, akaapole, nhimbalilanange na mpalanange mwangota kwa mwangota. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Nchimilange muno kubhee chilebhe chimo chichiletwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo, mu kutama kwa kuhengwa kukuntendanga mmangange pamo. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Gubhile mmele gumo na Mboomo jimo, handa henela chintekemwanga mu kulupalila kumo. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Kabhele abhile Hangwana jumo, kuhobhalela kumo na kubatichwa kumo, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Abhile Annoongo jumo yakubhee nga Atati jwa bhoa, jwaatawala hilebhe yoa, mu yoa na nkati ya yoa.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kila jumo jwitu atekupekewa umbone handa chibhapaalite Akilisito kumpekea. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Nga maana Majaandiko ga Annoongo galobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Pabhakajenda kunani muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">akatola libhoga lya bhandu bhala bhabhatabhitwe na kwabhoa kubhee ngwahupa kwa bhandu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Bahi, chiilobholekwa, “Akajaula kunani,” jibhii na maana niki? Maana gakwe nga kubhee, akajemeka kutuluka mpaka pahi pachilambo. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Bahi, jonojwe jwaatekutuluka nga jwaakajaula kunani muno kupeta kunani koha ili akombole kubhee poha. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Nga jwaatekwaapekeanga bhandu ngwahupa, bhangi akabhatenda kubhee akaandundame na bhangi akaalondohi, bhangi bhabhangange bhabhatangachanga Ngani Jammbone na bhangi bhabhaatandaanga bhandu bha Annoongo na bhabhajigananga. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Akatenda henela akombole kwaabhekanga maha bhandu bhoa bha Annoongo ligongo lya lihengo lya kwaatumikila Akilisito ili bhakombole bhakamilika handa chigubhile mmele gwa Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Henela, twabhoa tubhee chilebhe chimo mu kuhobhalela na kwaamanya muno Mwana jwa Annoongo, na tubhee bhandu tututekomala mu kuhobhalela na kuhikila kamilika kwa Akilisito mweene. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Bahi, tupakubheehopo handa bhaana hilemba, tubhikunokolwa kono na kono na kuhutwa na majigano ga namuna hijingi ga kwaatembanga bhandu, kwa kupenya na kwa kukagula ndela yabhenji ya kwaatembanga bhandu. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Nambo handa tupakugukagula ukweli kwa ntima gwa upaliho, tupakola mu Mboomo mu kwahikila Akilisito jwaabhile mutwe gwa mabhoga ga bhandu bhabhatekwahobhalela jonojwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Kwa kutandahikwa na Akilisito, yeega yoha ya mmele hitendakamulana pamo kwa linaanga, na mmele goha gukulupalila kujangatilwa na yeega yabhe. Bahi, kila cheega chibhikupangana lihengo lyabhe handa chiipalikwa, mmele goha gutendakola na kuchichenga mu upaliho.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umomi guyono na umomi gwa lolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Bahi, kwa ukolo gumbekiwe na Hangwana ndendakunkelebhuanga, nkotokutamanga kabhele handa bandu bhangaamanya Annoongo, bhabhatamanga kongo bhabhikuganikia hikubho yabhe hibohu. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Bhena bhandu luunda lwabhenji lutekubhee mulubhendu. Bhabhile kutali na umomi gwa Annoongo ligongo lya upumbavu kwabhenji kukubhile nkati jabhenji na kutauka kwabhenji. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Bhatekuhobhanga na bhanga honi, bhatekuchibheka mu hikubho hibohu, na kupangana hikubho hiyakwa, pangali kuleka.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Nambo mwangota mwangachijigana henela, kwa ngani ja Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Kweli ntekujoanga maha kwa ngani ja Ayesu na mwangota nga bhabhachijigana bhabhe, nkajiganwanga majigano kwa ngani ja Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Nkajiganwanga nnekange ganigela gabohu gantenditinge lolo handa mundu chibhuahula ngobho, hikubho yela hiitendita kuhabiliwa na kulokolila kwa unami. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Mitima na malango ginunji gagalambuke kubhee gayono. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Bahi mmangange na umomi guyono, handa henela Annoonga chibhammombitinge nnandane nabho, mmi bhammbone muno nnoongi jabhe na kutama chiipalikwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Henela nnekange kulongela unami! Kila mundu annobholele nnyakwe ukweli, maana kila jumo jwitu nga chiega cha mmele gwa Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Handa mpakuchimwanga, nkotokoonda lilaka linu lintendange mpangane mabohu, ngapena nkotokutama na lilaka kwa lichobha lyoa. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Kutumbala kumpekea Lichetani upenyo gwa kunchindanga. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Jonijola mundu jwaakibha abhwii, akaotokujibha kabhele, nambo ajemeke kupangana lihengo lyammbone kwa mabhoko gabhe, akombole kupata chilebhe cha kunnyangatila mundu jwaabhile ahocho. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Nkotokulongelanga malobhe gabohu, nambo nnongelange malobhe gammbone ga kwajangatila bhangi, kulandana na henela chibhapalanga, ili gabhajangatile bhangi bhabhanyohanikianga. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Nkotokunhumalia Mboomo jwa Annoongo, kwa kubhee Mboomo jonojwe nga amana ja Annoongo kwaachinunji kubhee mwangota nga bhandu bhabhe, na kulangia kubhee lichobha lipakuhika lya Annoongo kunkomboanga mwangota. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Bahi, nnekanange na mpwato na kutumbala na lilaka na nyenye na maligo. Nnekanange na kila ubohu. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Mmangange na ntima gwammbone na gwa kukolelana kiha, kila mundu na annekelele nnyakwe handa Annoongo chibhatekunnekelelanga mwangota, kupetela Akilisito.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kutama mu nhana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Mwangota nga Annoongo bhaana bhabhe jwaampalanga muno, henela nchimilange handa jonojwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Ntamange kwa kupalana, handa henela Akilisito chibhatekutupala twenga akachibhoa ligongo litu kubhee mbeeko ja kunungila muno na mbeeko jijaabhajila Annoongo.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Mwangota nga mwabhandu bha Annoongo, henela ngongola na hikubho hibohu yoayela na kulokolila kupanga hikubho hibohu hikotokubhee pakati jinunji. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kabhele pakotokubhee na malobhe gaakwa ga honi, au malobhe ga upuuzi au malobhe ga kutaukana yakubhee ngabhali gammbone, nambo mulongelenge malobhe ga kwaachukulu Annoongo nga gagapalikwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Kwa ngani ja hikubho heye muimanyange kweli kubhee, mundu joajola jwaapangana ngongola, au mundu ahakwa au mundu abohu au mundu joajola jwaabhii jwa kulokolila, mundu jwaalokolila alandana na mundu jwaachalila chidimu, ngapata ng'o choachela mu umwenye gwa Akilisito na gwa Annoongo.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mundu joajola akatokuntembanga kwa malobhe gangali kweli, kwa kubhee lilaka lya Annoongo litendakwaahikila ligongo lya hikubho handa yenjeni kwa bhenibhala bhandu bhabhangaajeketela Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Henela, nkotokuchikichana na bhandu bhabhapangana hikubho handa yeneyo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Pena lolo mkiibha mulubhendu kwa kubhee mkibhanga mwangaamanya Annoongo, nambo nangocheni mwangota mmi munhana ligongo mummanyanga Annoongo kwa kulondekana na Hangwana. Mtamange henela chibhapala Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Kwa kubhee kutama munhana kutenda kuleta umbone ukweli na kutama kwa kupangana hikubho hiikondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Nchimilange kugamanya genigala gabhaabhajila Hangwana. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Nkotokupangananga hikubho yela ya mulubhendu yangapalikwa, nambo mugabhekange palundwanje. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kwa kubhee gagapanganwa mulubhendu, nga honi hata kugalobhola. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Nambo kila chilebhe chichibhekitwe palundwaje hitendakubhonekana pandaa, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />kwa kubhee kila chilebhe chichitekuhunykylilwa chibheenga gutenda kila chilebhe chibhonekane. Nga maana hilobholekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Nnyimuke mwenga mwang'olwike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">nhyoke kubhoka kukujomoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">pena Akilisito apakummulikila.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Bahi mmangange maha henela chintamanga. Nkotokutamanga handa bhandu bhanga malango, nambo handa bhandu bhabhabhilinge na malango. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Ntumilange maha muuda gumupatite kwa kupangana hikubho yammbone, kwa maana machobha gangani nga gabohu. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Henela nkotokubhee akaajinga, nambo nnyigange kugamanya genigala gabhapala Hangwana. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Kabhele nkotokolelwa ugembe kwa kubhee ugembe gonogwe gupakuntendanga mpanganange hikubho ya honi, ila ntandaikwange na Mboomo jwa Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Nnyembange minyembo ya Zabuli, minyembo ja kulumbalila na minyembo jeengi jijitandahikwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo. Munnyembelange na kwaalumbalila Hangwana kwa mitima jinunji joa. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Mwaachukulu Annoongo Atati machokobha mu kila chilebhe kupetela lihina lya Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henela chiipalikwa kutama ahanu na analome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kila mundu antopee nnyakwe, ligongo ntendakwaatopea Akilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Mwangota akaahanu mwaajeketelange akaanalome bhinu handa chimwaajeketela Hangwana Ayesu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Kwa kubhee mwanalome nga nachilongola kwa hanu bhabhe handa henela Akilisito chibhatekubhee nachilongola mu libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela, yakubhee nga mmele gwabhe, na jono Akilisito nga Akombohi jwa mmele gwabhe. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Handa henela libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito chilitendakwaajeketela Akilisito, hela hela akaahanu bhabhaajeketelanga akanalome bhabhenji mu hikubho yoa.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Mwangota akaanalome, mwaapalange akahanu bhinu handa henela Akilisito chibhatekulipala libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela jonojwe kwa kuchibhoa mweene mmele gwabhe. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />akatenda henela ili kwa lilobhe lyabhe, kwaatendanga kubhee bhandu bha jika mu libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito kubhee lya kuhalala kwa kulijelejea lilobhe lyabhe kwa machi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />ili akombole kuchipatila lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito lilibhekitwe ligongo lya Annoongo, lyanga kulemwa kohakola, na chilebhe choachela chichilandana na genago. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Bahi, akanalome bhabhapalange akahanu bhabhe handa chibhahipalanga mimele jabhenji akaachinabhene. Jaapala hanu bhabhe achipala mweene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kwa maana jwaakwa mundu joajola jwaatendakuguchimwa mmele gwabhe, nambo bhatendakugulia na kuguweka ngobho. Henela nga Akilisito chibhalitendela lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyaahobhalela jonojwe, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />kwa kubhee twenga jika nga yeega ya mmele gwabhe, <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Handa chiitekujandikwa mu Majandiko ga Annoongo, “Ligongo helyo mwanalome apakwaaleka atati mundu na anyongo mundu bhabhe, na jonojwe apakulondanika na hanu bhabhe, na bhena bhabhele bhapakubhee mmele gumo.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Gagatekuchiiya nga makolongwa, nambo nenga ndendakulongela kwa ngani ja Akilisito na libhoga lya bhandu lilyaahobhalela jonojwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Nambo ganga Majandiko nga ligongo linunji kabhele, kila mwanalome apalikwa kwaapala hanu bhabhe handa chibhatendakuchipala mweene, na jonojwe hanumundu apalikwa kwaajeketela hangwana bhabhe.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Majigano kwa ngani ja bhaana na akaabhelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Mwangota bhana, mwaajeketelange akaabhelei bhinu mu Hangwana, kwa kubhee heche nga chikubho chammbone. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Lilagilo lya kujemeka libhakalobhola Annoongo nga, “Mwaatopeange atati na anyongo bhinu, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />ili, nchipatile umbone gwabhe na ntame kwa machobha gajingi pachilambo.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Mwangota akaatati, nnekange kwaatendelanga hikubho hibohu bhana bhinunji, nambo mwaalelange mu kupangana hikubho yammbone na majigano kubhoka kwa Hangwana<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majigano kwa akaabhanda na akaakolo bhabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Mwangota akaabhanda mwaajeketelange akaakolo bhinu pamba pachilambo kwa kujogopa na kulendemela, ntendange henela kwa ntima gwambone handa chimwatumikila Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ntendelange henela ngabha tu penipala pabhannolanga bhandu ili nkombolange kuchipendekea pendea kwabhenji ili mmonekane kubhee bhammbone, nambo ntumikange kwa ntima handa chibhapala Annoongo kwa kubhee mwangota nga akaabhanda bha Akilisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Ntendange mahengo ginunji kongo mmi kuhangalala handa henela chintendakwaatumikila Hangwana na nga mwaatumikilange akaakolo bhuinu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Nkombokelange kubhee kila mundu jwaapangana gammbone, handa nga abhanda au mundu jwanga abhanda, apakupokela ngwahupa jabhe kubhoka kwa Hangwana.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Mwangota akaakolo, mwaatendelange helahela akaabhanda bhinu, na nnekenge kwaajogoanga. Nkombokelange mwangota na bhenangota mmi na Hangwana jumo tu jwaabhii kunani, na jonojwe ngaagula mundu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo ja chimboomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ngapena, ndendakuntakianga mmangange bhakuhimalikanga mu kulondanika na Hangwana na kwa kujangatilwa na machili gabhee makolo. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />nhwalange hilebhe ya kupotanila mu ngondo hibhatekunpekeanga Annoongo, kupala nkombolange kukana hikubho hibohu ya Lichetani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Maana ngoondo yitu ngapotana na bhandu, nambo tupotana na mabhoga mabohu mu chilambo cha mboomo, tupotana na akaatabhala bhakwetinge machili na akaakolo bhabhatabhala chilambo chenjeni cha lubhendu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ligongo helyo muwalange hilebhe ya kupotanila mu ngoondo hinpatitinge kubhoka kwa Annoongo ili palipakuhika lichobha lya kulaga nkombolange kugapeta gena machili ga jono abohu, pampakujomolanga kupotana mpakombola kubhee na machili. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Bahi mmangane tiyali. Ukweli na gubhee handa nkanda pachibhuno chinu, kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kubhee handa chiwalo cha kuchilenda patandala, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />ndendakulokolila kutangacha Ngani Jammbone ja kuhengwa jibhee handa hilatu mu makongono ginunji. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Kuhobhalela kwinu machobha goa kubhee handa chilebhe cha kuchihibhila muuda gwa ngoondo mmabhoko ginunji, ibhatendange kuhima nkoha gwa mooto gwa jonijola Lichetani. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Mpokelange kukombolewa handa kopia jinunji ja chiano, na lilobhe lya Annoongo handa upanga ntekupewanga na Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Nnyopange machobha goa handa Mboomo jwa Annoogo chibhantandaanga mu muuda gwa kujopa, muuda goa mmangange tiyali kwaajopelanga bhandu bhoa bha Annoongo. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Hela hela nnyopalange na nenga kabhele ili Annoongo akombole kumbekea malobhe ga kulongela na nenga ngombole kunnobholelanga genigala gagatekuchiiya mu Ngani Jammbone pangali lipamba. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Annoongo andumite kutangacha Ngani Jammbone hata handa ngocheni ndekutabhwa. Nyopange, ili ngoto kubhee na lipamba ndangache handa chiipalikwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chalaamu ja kujomolekea.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tukiko, anung'una jwitu tutumpala muno na antumichi jwa kuaminika mu kulondekana na Hangwana, apakunnobholelanga ngani yangu yoa ili nkombolange kumanya chiimbangana nangocheni. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ndekwaatuma jonojwe kwaachinunji ampekeange ngani yitu ili mkombalange kumanya ngani yitu na kulekelwa ntima.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Henela akaanung'una bhangu ndendakwaajopa Atati Annoongo na Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito ampekeange mwangota kuhengwa na upaliho na kuhobhalela. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Ndendakwaajopa Annoongo ampekeange umbone mwangota mwabhoa mumpalanga Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito kwa upaliho gwangali kupela.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>